<title>USA: U.S. stock index futures end mostly higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. stock index futures end mostly higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>Aug 14 - U.S. stock index futures ended mostly higher amid light to moderate afternoon trade. Sept S&amp;P 500 ends up but off the morning's high. Tarders tie late bounce to firm T-bond futures close, but say S&amp;P gains tentative and mood remains nervous.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk, 312-408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: chicago.derivatives.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
